The [[Ripsaw Blade]] is a legendary [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all classes. It deals relatively high damage by default, and slowly gains damage while also removing the damage gained in battle from all opponent's [[weapon]]s. This only applies to a subset of possible weapons one might encounter. It works against weapons like the [[Torch]], which gains damage due to its triggered on hit effect, but doesn't apply to weapons like the [[Thorn Whip]], which has damage increases related to a passive effect.

When combined with a [[Whetstone]], the [[Ripsaw Blade]] becomes the [[Katana]], which is better in every way, attacking faster, gaining more damage, and removing buffs from the opponent.

[[Engineer]]s can combine the [[Ripsaw Blade]] with a [[Coil]] to obtain the [[Chainsaw]], which steals buffs and is mostly better, but attacks slower over time.
